window.AZT_EX = {"p1-mot-nguoi":[{"src":"ETS 2026 · Test 1 · Câu 1","k":"t1-1","part":1,"audio":"E26-T01-01.mp3","options":["The woman is carrying a tray of food.","The woman is wearing a jacket.","The woman is tying up her hair.","The woman is removing her hat."],"answer":1,"img":"q1.jpg","note":"Nhìn tranh trước: một phụ nữ mặc áo khoác phao, tay đang thả đồ vào thùng. (B) \"is wearing a jacket\" tả TRẠNG THÁI đang mặc, khớp tranh. (A) không có khay đồ ăn. (C) tóc không đang được buộc. (D) \"removing her hat\" là động tác cởi mũ, trong khi chiếc mũ rơm nằm trên thùng gỗ bên phải: bẫy nhắc đúng đồ vật trong tranh nhưng sai hành động."},{"src":"ETS 2026 · Test 2 · Câu 6","k":"t2-6","part":1,"audio":"E26-T02-06.mp3","options":["He's setting up a buffet.","He's putting plates on dining tables.","He's watering some plants in a garden.","He's carrying food up a stairway."],"answer":0,"img":"t02-q6.jpg","note":"Người đàn ông đứng cạnh các khay hâm nóng thức ăn ngoài trời, đang sắp xếp. \"set up a buffet\" (bày tiệc đứng) đúng cảnh. (B) không có bàn ăn hay đĩa đang được đặt. (C) có cây xanh nhưng không ai tưới, bẫy dùng đồ vật nền. (D) có cầu thang phía sau nhưng anh ấy không mang đồ lên cầu thang. Quy tắc: đồ vật ở hậu cảnh hay bị lấy làm bẫy."}],"p1-nhieu-nguoi":[{"src":"ETS 2026 · Test 3 · Câu 4","k":"t3-4","part":1,"audio":"E26-T03-04.mp3","options":["They're leaving a restaurant.","They're seated next to each other.","One of the women is looking in her handbag.","One of the women is folding a scarf."],"answer":1,"img":"t03-q4.jpg","note":"Hai phụ nữ ngồi sát nhau xem thực đơn. Hành động CHUNG của cả hai là đang ngồi → (B) \"seated next to each other\". (A) họ không rời nhà hàng. (C) có túi đeo trước người nhưng không ai nhìn vào túi. (D) khăn quàng đang đeo, không ai gấp. Với tranh nhiều người, nghe kỹ chủ ngữ \"They\" hay \"One of the women\"."},{"src":"ETS 2026 · Test 4 · Câu 5","k":"t4-5","part":1,"audio":"E26-T04-05.mp3","options":["One of the women is carrying a bag on her shoulder.","One of the women is placing her luggage on a scale.","Some suitcases have been lined up against the wall.","Some clothes are being packed in a bag."],"answer":0,"img":"t04-q5.jpg","note":"Ba người đi trong sân bay kéo vali, người giữa đeo túi trên vai. (A) \"One of the women is carrying a bag on her shoulder\" đúng với 1 người cụ thể. (B) không có cân hành lý. (C) vali đang được kéo, không xếp dọc tường. (D) \"are being packed\" là bị động tiếp diễn, cần người đang xếp đồ, tranh không có. Gặp \"is/are being + V3\" nhớ kiểm tra có người đang làm việc đó không."}],"p2-wh":[{"src":"ETS 2026 · Test 1 · Câu 13","k":"t1-13","part":2,"audio":"E26-T01-13.mp3","options":["No, it's not very heavy.","About 20 meters.","We close at 6 o'clock."],"answer":2,"q":"What time can I pick up my glasses?","note":"Hỏi \"What time\" → chờ một mốc giờ. (C) \"We close at 6 o'clock\" là trả lời gián tiếp: không nói giờ lấy kính nhưng cho biết lấy trước 6 giờ là được. (A) bắt đầu bằng \"No\", câu Wh- không trả lời Yes/No. (B) là khoảng cách, trả lời cho \"How far\"."},{"src":"ETS 2026 · Test 1 · Câu 20","k":"t1-20","part":2,"audio":"E26-T01-20.mp3","options":["No, I haven't received my confirmation e-mail yet.","My winter coat.","Because someone just took the last one."],"answer":2,"q":"Why aren't there any brochures in the lobby?","note":"\"Why\" → chờ lý do. (C) \"Because someone just took the last one\" đúng. (A) \"No…\" không trả lời Why. (B) \"My winter coat\" lạc đề. Câu Why không bắt buộc có \"Because\", nhưng có thì thường là đáp án."}],"p2-yesno":[{"src":"ETS 2026 · Test 1 · Câu 19","k":"t1-19","part":2,"audio":"E26-T01-19.mp3","options":["You can borrow mine.","I'll have to check my calendar.","Yes, it was a good meeting."],"answer":1,"q":"Is your dental appointment next Tuesday?","note":"Câu Yes/No về lịch hẹn. Đáp án đúng (B) không nói Yes hay No mà \"để tôi xem lịch\", kiểu trả lời \"tôi chưa chắc\" rất hay gặp. (C) có \"Yes\" nhưng nói về cuộc họp đã qua (was), sai cả thì lẫn chủ đề. (A) lạc đề."},{"src":"ETS 2026 · Test 1 · Câu 14","k":"t1-14","part":2,"audio":"E26-T01-14.mp3","options":["It's on the lower shelf.","A 12:30 departure.","I haven't seen them using it yet."],"answer":2,"q":"The sales team knows how to use the tracking software, don't they?","note":"Câu hỏi đuôi \"…, don't they?\" = hỏi Yes/No. (C) \"I haven't seen them using it yet\" là trả lời gián tiếp (ngụ ý: chắc là chưa biết). (A) trả lời Where, (B) trả lời When. Đáp án gián tiếp kiểu \"tôi chưa thấy / để tôi kiểm tra\" chiếm phần lớn câu khó Part 2."}],"p2-tran-thuat":[{"src":"ETS 2026 · Test 1 · Câu 24","k":"t1-24","part":2,"audio":"E26-T01-24.mp3","options":["Actually, they're 15.","No, I can't play the guitar.","It's in aisle five."],"answer":0,"q":"The tickets to Friday night's concert cost 10 dollars each.","note":"Câu trần thuật nêu thông tin \"vé 10 đô\". Đáp án (A) \"Actually, they're 15\" là cải chính. \"Actually\" là tín hiệu rất hay đứng đầu đáp án đúng của câu trần thuật. (B) bẫy liên tưởng concert → guitar. (C) trả lời Where."},{"src":"ETS 2026 · Test 3 · Câu 26","k":"t3-26","part":2,"audio":"E26-T03-26.mp3","options":["My phone has an extended warranty.","What are the qualifications?","Yes, you completed your project."],"answer":1,"q":"Our department's looking for more interns.","note":"Câu trần thuật \"phòng tôi đang tìm thêm thực tập sinh\". Đáp án (B) là hỏi ngược lại \"yêu cầu là gì?\", cách phản hồi tự nhiên. (A) lạc đề. (C) có \"Yes\" nhưng nói chuyện dự án đã xong. Với câu trần thuật, đáp án hay là câu hỏi lại, lời khen, hoặc cải chính."}],"p2-de-nghi":[{"src":"ETS 2026 · Test 1 · Câu 16","k":"t1-16","part":2,"audio":"E26-T01-16.mp3","options":["That was a great book.","OK, I'd be happy to.","He doesn't have any more."],"answer":1,"q":"Would you be able to write the introduction for the workshop?","note":"Lời nhờ \"Would you be able to…?\" → chờ đồng ý hoặc từ chối. (B) \"OK, I'd be happy to\" là đồng ý chuẩn. (A) bẫy liên tưởng introduction → book. (C) \"He\" không có người để chỉ."},{"src":"ETS 2026 · Test 4 · Câu 30","k":"t4-30","part":2,"audio":"E26-T04-30.mp3","options":["Let's put it in the back seat.","At the Maple Street station.","There is a processing fee."],"answer":2,"q":"Can you please transfer the service to my new phone?","note":"Lời nhờ chuyển dịch vụ sang điện thoại mới. Đáp án (C) \"Có phí xử lý\" là trả lời gián tiếp: không nói đồng ý mà báo một điều kiện. (A) back seat lạc đề. (B) trả lời Where. Đề 750+ hay dùng kiểu đáp này cho câu đề nghị."}],"p2-lua-chon":[{"src":"ETS 2026 · Test 2 · Câu 9","k":"t2-9","part":2,"audio":"E26-T02-09.mp3","options":["An electric heater.","Page 25.","Either way is fine."],"answer":2,"q":"Would you like the report to be e-mailed or printed out?","note":"Câu lựa chọn \"e-mail hay in ra?\". Đáp án (C) \"Either way is fine\" (cách nào cũng được) là kiểu chọn cả hai, rất hay ra. (A) \"electric heater\" bẫy âm giống e-mailed. (B) lạc đề. Các đáp án dạng \"either/neither/whichever/both\" luôn là ứng viên mạnh."},{"src":"ETS 2026 · Test 1 · Câu 28","k":"t1-28","part":2,"audio":"E26-T01-28.mp3","options":["I'm taking a client to lunch.","On the corner of 4th and Main.","The daily special is soup and a sandwich."],"answer":0,"q":"Would you rather go to lunch now or at noon?","note":"Câu lựa chọn \"đi ăn trưa bây giờ hay lúc 12 giờ?\". Đáp án (A) \"Tôi đang đưa khách hàng đi ăn\" không chọn phương án nào, ngụ ý không đi cùng được. (C) bẫy lặp chủ đề lunch. (B) trả lời Where. Câu lựa chọn KHÔNG trả lời bằng Yes/No."}],"p3-chu-de":[{"src":"ETS 2026 · Test 1 · Câu 32","k":"t1-32","part":3,"audio":"E26-T01-32-34.mp3","group":"Câu 32–34","q":"What type of food product does the speakers' company sell?","options":["Candy","Cheese","Bread","Pasta"],"answer":1,"script":[{"sp":"W","seg":[{"t":"Hey Oliver,"},{"t":"did you see the focus group results for our new spicy cheddar cheese? Everyone really liked it.","hit":1}]},{"sp":"M","seg":[{"t":"Yes,"},{"t":"it should be a great addition to our company's line of cheeses. Several people mentioned that they'd like to use it in recipes, to add to sauces for example.","hit":1},{"t":"So maybe we should consider selling a shredded version that would melt easily when cooked."}]},{"sp":"W","seg":[{"t":"I'm sure we could do that."},{"t":"I'll get in touch with the production manager with that request."}]}],"para":"our new spicy cheddar cheese / our company's line of cheeses → Cheese","note":"Câu hỏi chung: công ty bán sản phẩm gì. Thông tin nằm ngay 2 câu đầu: \"our new spicy cheddar cheese\", \"our company's line of cheeses\". Câu hỏi chung (chủ đề, nơi làm việc, nghề) gần như luôn có đáp án trong 2–3 câu mở đầu, nên phải sẵn sàng từ giây đầu tiên."},{"src":"ETS 2026 · Test 1 · Câu 35","k":"t1-35","part":3,"audio":"E26-T01-35-37.mp3","group":"Câu 35–37","q":"Why is the man calling?","options":["To sign up for lessons","To enter a competition","To buy tickets to an event","To ask about branded merchandise"],"answer":2,"script":[{"sp":"M","seg":[{"t":"Hi."},{"t":"I'm calling to book three tickets for this Thursday's tennis match. Are there any seats left?","hit":1}]},{"sp":"W","t":"Just a few. Tickets for Thursday's match have been selling quickly."},{"sp":"M","seg":[{"t":"I'm not surprised. After all,"},{"t":"Ife Rotimi won the regional championship tournament last month. Everyone wants to see her play after her incredible performance. What seats are available?"}]},{"sp":"W","seg":[{"t":"Well, there's only one group of three seats together."},{"t":"Advance payment is required to hold them."}]}],"para":"calling to book three tickets for … tennis match → To buy tickets to an event","note":"\"Why is the man calling?\" → nghe câu mở đầu của người gọi. \"I'm calling to book three tickets for … tennis match\" được diễn đạt lại thành \"To buy tickets to an event\". Mẫu \"I'm calling to/about…\" là tín hiệu chắc chắn của câu mục đích cuộc gọi."}],"p3-hanh-dong":[{"src":"ETS 2026 · Test 1 · Câu 33","k":"t1-33","part":3,"audio":"E26-T01-32-34.mp3","group":"Câu 32–34","q":"What does the man suggest?","options":["Lowering prices","Hiring more workers","Publishing a recipe","Offering additional options"],"answer":3,"script":[{"sp":"W","seg":[{"t":"Hey Oliver,"},{"t":"did you see the focus group results for our new spicy cheddar cheese? Everyone really liked it."}]},{"sp":"M","seg":[{"t":"Yes,"},{"t":"it should be a great addition to our company's line of cheeses. Several people mentioned that they'd like to use it in recipes, to add to sauces for example."},{"t":"So maybe we should consider selling a shredded version that would melt easily when cooked.","hit":1}]},{"sp":"W","seg":[{"t":"I'm sure we could do that."},{"t":"I'll get in touch with the production manager with that request."}]}],"para":"selling a shredded version → Offering additional options","note":"Câu \"What does the man suggest?\" → chờ cụm gợi ý của người đàn ông: \"maybe we should consider selling a shredded version\". Bán thêm loại phô mai bào = \"Offering additional options\". Cụm báo hiệu lời gợi ý: maybe we should, why don't we, how about, I recommend."},{"src":"ETS 2026 · Test 1 · Câu 40","k":"t1-40","part":3,"audio":"E26-T01-38-40.mp3","group":"Câu 38–40","q":"What does the woman say she will do?","options":["E-mail a list","Speak with a colleague","Provide a password","Post a job opening"],"answer":0,"script":[{"sp":"W","seg":[{"t":"Thanks for agreeing to help me organize"},{"t":"the library's annual fund-raising dinner, Klaus. We hope the event brings in enough money to expand our children's book section."}]},{"sp":"M","t":"What task would you like me to start with?"},{"sp":"W","seg":[{"t":"Well, I could use some help sending out the invitations."}]},{"sp":"M","t":"OK, I can take care of that. Is there a list of attendees available?"},{"sp":"W","seg":[{"t":"It's in my computer files."},{"t":"I'll e-mail it to you.","hit":1}]}],"para":"I'll e-mail it to you (a list of attendees) → E-mail a list","note":"\"What does the woman say she will do?\" là câu hành động tiếp theo, đáp án thường ở CUỐI hội thoại: \"I'll e-mail it to you\", với \"it\" là danh sách khách mời → \"E-mail a list\". Nhớ: I'll / Let me / I'm going to ở cuối bài = đáp án câu cuối nhóm."}],"p3-chi-tiet":[{"src":"ETS 2026 · Test 1 · Câu 37","k":"t1-37","part":3,"audio":"E26-T01-35-37.mp3","group":"Câu 35–37","q":"What does the woman say is required?","options":["A parking permit","A photo ID","Contact information","Advance payment"],"answer":3,"script":[{"sp":"M","seg":[{"t":"Hi."},{"t":"I'm calling to book three tickets for this Thursday's tennis match. Are there any seats left?"}]},{"sp":"W","t":"Just a few. Tickets for Thursday's match have been selling quickly."},{"sp":"M","seg":[{"t":"I'm not surprised. After all,"},{"t":"Ife Rotimi won the regional championship tournament last month. Everyone wants to see her play after her incredible performance. What seats are available?"}]},{"sp":"W","seg":[{"t":"Well, there's only one group of three seats together."},{"t":"Advance payment is required to hold them.","hit":1}]}],"para":"Advance payment is required → Advance payment","note":"Câu chi tiết: cái gì là bắt buộc. Từ khoá \"required\" xuất hiện y nguyên ở câu cuối: \"Advance payment is required to hold them\". Mẹo: từ khoá câu hỏi (required) thường được nói lại gần như nguyên văn, nghe thấy nó thì đáp án ở ngay đó."},{"src":"ETS 2026 · Test 1 · Câu 42","k":"t1-42","part":3,"audio":"E26-T01-41-43.mp3","group":"Câu 41–43","q":"What is mentioned about some pens?","options":["They are available in multiple colors.","They use permanent ink.","They are preferred by book authors.","They are made from paper."],"answer":3,"script":[{"sp":"W","seg":[{"t":"Hey Brian and Mateo, I found some great pens to give away at the"},{"t":"community festival to promote our business."}]},{"sp":"M","t":"Great! Can we put our cleaning service logo on them?"},{"sp":"W","seg":[{"t":"Yes, for no extra charge."},{"t":"And they're biodegradable.","hit":1},{"t":"They're made from paper.","hit":1}]},{"sp":"M2","t":"So when we hand them out, we can mention that, as well as talk about the organic cleaning supplies our company uses."},{"sp":"W","seg":[{"t":"OK,"},{"t":"I'll go ahead and order several cases."}]}],"para":"They're made from paper → They are made from paper.","note":"Câu hỏi \"What is mentioned about some pens?\" là dạng \"điều gì được nhắc tới\", phải nghe hết đoạn nói về bút. \"They're made from paper\" khớp (D). (A) màu sắc, (B) mực không phai, (C) tác giả sách đều không được nhắc. Logo hay \"no extra charge\" cũng nói về bút nhưng không nằm trong phương án."}],"p3-y-dinh":[{"src":"ETS 2026 · Test 1 · Câu 55","k":"t1-55","part":3,"audio":"E26-T01-53-55.mp3","group":"Câu 53–55","q":"What does the woman mean when she says, “it's supposed to be below freezing tonight”?","options":["She is surprised by the weather forecast.","She wants a service to be completed sooner.","She will move some items indoors.","She would prefer to park near her apartment."],"answer":1,"script":[{"sp":"M","seg":[{"t":"You've reached the maintenance office at Hillview apartment complex."}]},{"sp":"W","seg":[{"t":"Hi, this is Pallavi Sen from Unit 35B."},{"t":"I'm calling because the new thermostat in my apartment isn't working. It keeps shutting off and turning on randomly, so my apartment is getting cold."}]},{"sp":"M","t":"When did this issue start?"},{"sp":"W","t":"A few hours ago. The thermostat was just installed yesterday."},{"sp":"M","seg":[{"t":"OK,"},{"t":"I can come and take a look at it tomorrow morning.","hit":1}]},{"sp":"W","seg":[{"t":"But it's supposed to be below freezing tonight.","hit":1}]}],"para":"tomorrow morning → below freezing tonight → She wants a service to be completed sooner.","note":"Câu ý ngầm: phải hiểu câu được trích nằm trong ngữ cảnh nào. Nhân viên hẹn \"sáng mai\"; người phụ nữ đáp \"But tối nay trời sẽ dưới 0 độ\". Chữ \"But\" cho thấy cô không đồng ý chờ tới mai, tức là muốn được sửa sớm hơn → (B). (A) bẫy hiểu theo nghĩa đen về dự báo thời tiết."},{"src":"ETS 2026 · Test 1 · Câu 90","k":"t1-90","part":4,"audio":"E26-T01-89-91.mp3","group":"Câu 89–91","q":"What does the speaker mean when she says, “All of ours are at least ten years old”?","options":["An event needs to be relocated.","An upgrade is not feasible.","A project team has a lot of experience.","Some company policies are outdated."],"answer":1,"script":[{"sp":"W","seg":[{"t":"After the Transportation Agency released the draft of our Improvement Plan last week,"},{"t":"members of the press asked if we're considering installing more fuel-efficient engines in our trains."},{"t":"I've scheduled this press conference to officially respond to your inquiries. Eighteen months ago, we hired a firm to determine if this upgrade would be feasible for our trains."},{"t":"It reported that the upgrade would be economical only for relatively new trains, that is, those less than five years old.","hit":1},{"t":"All of ours are at least ten years old. I hope this addresses your questions.","hit":1},{"t":"If you're interested in more details, e-mail our media relations department to receive a summary of the findings."}]}],"para":"economical only for trains less than five years old → All of ours are at least ten years old → An upgrade is not feasible.","note":"Câu ý ngầm (Part 4). Ngay trước câu trích: nâng cấp chỉ hiệu quả với tàu dưới 5 năm tuổi. \"Tất cả tàu của chúng tôi đều trên 10 năm\" → không nâng cấp được = \"An upgrade is not feasible\". Cách làm: nghe câu ngay TRƯỚC câu trích, đó là chìa khoá suy ra ý."}],"p3-bieu-do":[{"src":"ETS 2026 · Test 2 · Câu 63","k":"t2-63","part":3,"audio":"E26-T02-62-64.mp3","group":"Câu 62–64","q":"Look at the graphic. How much does the man's coffee cost?","options":["$2.00","$3.25","$3.75","$4.25"],"answer":2,"script":[{"sp":"M","t":"I really need this coffee break. My morning meeting with my client was really… challenging."},{"sp":"W","t":"What were you discussing?"},{"sp":"M","seg":[{"t":"The project schedule."},{"t":"They asked us to provide the prototype design to them three weeks earlier than originally planned."}]},{"sp":"W","t":"Well, then today's cup is my treat. Which one would you like?"},{"sp":"M","seg":[{"t":"That's so nice of you."},{"t":"I'll go with the White Cloud coffee. I like a little milk in mine.","hit":1}]},{"sp":"W","t":"Good choice. So I have some news to share with you. Did you hear about David?"},{"sp":"M","t":"No. What's going on?"},{"sp":"W","seg":[{"t":"Apparently he's planning to retire next month."}]}],"para":"the White Cloud coffee → bảng giá: $3.75","img":"t02-q63.jpg","note":"Câu có biểu đồ: nhìn bảng giá trước khi nghe. Người nói không nhắc giá, chỉ nói tên món \"White Cloud coffee\" → dò bảng: White Cloud = $3.75. Quy tắc: lời thoại nói thông tin ở CỘT KIA của bảng (tên món), đáp án nằm ở cột còn lại (giá)."},{"src":"ETS 2026 · Test 1 · Câu 66","k":"t1-66","part":3,"audio":"E26-T01-65-67.mp3","group":"Câu 65–67","q":"Which page on the Web site does the man want to change?","options":["Page 1","Page 2","Page 3","Page 4"],"answer":0,"script":[{"sp":"M","seg":[{"t":"Marion, we keep getting calls from people who want to visit"},{"t":"the botanical garden but can't find parking information."}]},{"sp":"W","t":"Isn't it on our Web site?"},{"sp":"M","seg":[{"t":"It is, but"},{"t":"you have to click on the About Us page and scroll to the bottom of that page. Maybe people don't see it.","hit":1},{"t":"I think we should move that information from the About Us page and make a separate page for directions and parking information. That way, people can find it more easily.","hit":1}]},{"sp":"W","seg":[{"t":"I'd be happy to make that change, but"},{"t":"we're in the middle of updating our software, so it'll have to wait until Monday."}]}],"para":"move that information from the About Us page → bảng: Page 1","img":"q66.jpg","note":"Biểu đồ là sơ đồ trang web. Người đàn ông nói thông tin bãi đỗ xe đang ở trang \"About Us\" và muốn chuyển đi. Dò sơ đồ: About Us là Page 1 → (A). Không bao giờ nghe thấy \"Page 1\"; phải nối tên trang với số trang."}],"p4-bo-cuc":[{"src":"ETS 2026 · Test 1 · Câu 71","k":"t1-71","part":4,"audio":"E26-T01-71-73.mp3","group":"Câu 71–73","q":"What type of products does the business repair?","options":["Computers","Vehicles","Light fixtures","Kitchen appliances"],"answer":1,"script":[{"sp":"S","seg":[{"t":"You've reached Select Repair Service."},{"t":"We specialize in all makes and models of automobiles. Our factory-trained specialists will keep your vehicle running in top condition.","hit":1},{"t":"As an added benefit, we offer extended warranties on all vehicles we service. You can enjoy three extra years of worry-free driving."},{"t":"Please note that Select Repair Service will be closing on Friday, June 30th, so we can complete our quarterly inventory of supplies. Thank you for your patience. A representative will be with you shortly."}]}],"para":"all makes and models of automobiles → Vehicles","note":"Tin nhắn thoại của tiệm sửa chữa. Câu hỏi chung về sản phẩm được sửa: câu thứ 2 \"all makes and models of automobiles\", câu sau nhắc lại \"your vehicle\" → Vehicles. Bài nói Part 4 mở đầu bằng giới thiệu (ai, ở đâu, sản phẩm gì): câu hỏi đầu nhóm gần như luôn ở đó."},{"src":"ETS 2026 · Test 1 · Câu 83","k":"t1-83","part":4,"audio":"E26-T01-83-85.mp3","group":"Câu 83–85","q":"What is the announcement mainly about?","options":["A promotional event","A vacation package","A building renovation","A travel delay"],"answer":3,"script":[{"sp":"S","seg":[{"t":"Attention, passengers!"},{"t":"All trains to Midway Station are delayed for track repairs. Repair crews are working on a stretch of track just south of the town of Weeden. They expect to complete the repair within the hour. We apologize for the delay.","hit":1},{"t":"We understand that many commuters need to get to Midway as soon as possible."},{"t":"A bus will be departing for that destination in 15 minutes."},{"t":"Also, a reminder that the station café opens at 8 A.M. and there are food kiosks on Platform 1."}]}],"para":"All trains to Midway Station are delayed → A travel delay","note":"\"What is the announcement mainly about?\" → ý chính nằm ở câu đầu: \"All trains to Midway Station are delayed for track repairs\" = \"A travel delay\". (C) có từ repair nhưng là sửa đường ray chứ không phải cải tạo toà nhà, bẫy trùng từ."}],"p4-yeu-cau":[{"src":"ETS 2026 · Test 1 · Câu 79","k":"t1-79","part":4,"audio":"E26-T01-77-79.mp3","group":"Câu 77–79","q":"What does the speaker ask the listener to confirm?","options":["Whether a new product will be available soon","When a replacement part will be shipped","How long a warranty lasts","Who to contact about future orders"],"answer":0,"script":[{"sp":"W","seg":[{"t":"Hello, this is Heather Ross calling from"},{"t":"Denville Amusement Park. About a month ago I ordered one of your new video game machines, Space Defenders."},{"t":"I'm really happy with my purchase since the game has been incredibly popular with our park guests. I'm considering buying some additional machines in the near future."},{"t":"I heard you may be releasing a new game soon.","hit":1},{"t":"Could you call me back and let me know if that's true? Thanks.","hit":1}]}],"para":"releasing a new game soon … let me know if that's true → Whether a new product will be available soon","note":"Câu \"ask the listener to confirm\" → đáp án ở cuối tin nhắn: \"Could you call me back and let me know if that's true?\", với \"that\" = việc ra game mới. Cả chuỗi được tóm lại thành \"Whether a new product will be available soon\". Lời nhờ trong tin nhắn thoại hầu như luôn ở 1–2 câu cuối."},{"src":"ETS 2026 · Test 5 · Câu 82","k":"t5-82","part":4,"audio":"E26-T05-80-82.mp3","group":"Câu 80–82","q":"What does the speaker ask the listeners to do?","options":["Get ready to watch a video","Applaud the winner","Share copies of a handout","Read a set of directions"],"answer":0,"script":[{"sp":"S","seg":[{"t":"The Novikov Award is named after Maxim Novikov,"},{"t":"the founder of Novikov Aviation. It is given each year to a company that has made outstanding contributions to the aviation industry. The company chosen for the award this year was frustrated by the lack of qualified job applicants and decided to do something about it."},{"t":"Zenith Aviation's apprenticeship program has trained hundreds of workers for careers in aircraft maintenance and repair. Dozens of firms nationwide have copied the program."},{"t":"Before I present the award, please direct your attention to the screen for a video highlighting the program's effectiveness.","hit":1}]}],"para":"direct your attention to the screen for a video → Get ready to watch a video","note":"\"What does the speaker ask the listeners to do?\" → câu cuối: \"please direct your attention to the screen for a video\" = chuẩn bị xem video. (B) bẫy liên tưởng: đang trao giải nên dễ chọn vỗ tay. Tín hiệu yêu cầu: please, I'd like you to, make sure, don't forget to."}],"p5-gioi-lien":[{"src":"ETS 2026 · Test 1 · Câu 121","k":"t1-121","part":5,"q":"Ennis Photography purchased all new lighting equipment ------- the high cost.","options":["even though","however","until","despite"],"answer":3,"note":"Phương án là giới từ / liên từ / trạng từ. Sau chỗ trống là CỤM DANH TỪ \"the high cost\" (không có động từ) → cần giới từ: despite. \"even though\" là liên từ, phải đi với mệnh đề có động từ. \"however\" là trạng từ, không nối trực tiếp. \"until\" sai nghĩa."},{"src":"ETS 2026 · Test 1 · Câu 118","k":"t1-118","part":5,"q":"The finance director gave his approval ------- the project can move forward.","options":["along","furthermore","cautiously","so that"],"answer":3,"note":"Sau chỗ trống là MỆNH ĐỀ đủ chủ ngữ + động từ \"the project can move forward\" → cần liên từ: \"so that\" (để mà). \"furthermore\" là trạng từ liên kết, không nối 2 mệnh đề trong 1 câu. \"along\" và \"cautiously\" không nối mệnh đề."}],"p5-tu-loai":[{"src":"ETS 2026 · Test 1 · Câu 106","k":"t1-106","part":5,"q":"The hiring manager ------- considered each applicant's résumé and qualifications.","options":["caring","careful","carefully","carefulness"],"answer":2,"note":"Chỗ trống đứng giữa chủ ngữ và động từ \"considered\" → cần trạng từ bổ nghĩa động từ: carefully. Đuôi -ly là trạng từ, -ful là tính từ, -ness là danh từ. Làm dạng từ loại chỉ cần nhìn 2 từ hai bên chỗ trống, không cần dịch cả câu."},{"src":"ETS 2026 · Test 1 · Câu 116","k":"t1-116","part":5,"q":"Theta Industries' training program aims to increase the ------- of its manufacturing systems.","options":["producer","produced","productive","productivity"],"answer":3,"note":"\"the ------- of\" → sau mạo từ \"the\" và trước \"of\" phải là DANH TỪ. Có 2 danh từ: producer (người sản xuất) và productivity (năng suất). Tăng \"năng suất của hệ thống\" mới hợp nghĩa → productivity. Khi có 2 danh từ, chọn theo nghĩa: người hay vật/khái niệm."}],"p5-tu-vung":[{"src":"ETS 2026 · Test 1 · Câu 105","k":"t1-105","part":5,"q":"To stop the ------- of computer viruses, do not open suspicious e-mails.","options":["break","spread","balance","surface"],"answer":1,"note":"Cả 4 phương án cùng từ loại → dạng từ vựng, phải hiểu nghĩa. \"the spread of computer viruses\" = sự lây lan của virus. Collocation cần thuộc: spread of a virus / disease / information."},{"src":"ETS 2026 · Test 1 · Câu 113","k":"t1-113","part":5,"q":"Analysts cannot say with any ------- what the regional demand for electric trucks will be.","options":["certainty","justice","excellence","denial"],"answer":0,"note":"Cụm cố định \"say with (any) certainty\" = nói chắc chắn. \"Không thể nói chắc chắn nhu cầu sẽ thế nào\" hợp nghĩa. Ba từ còn lại (justice, excellence, denial) không đi với \"say with\". Mẹo: học từ vựng Part 5 theo cụm, không học từ đơn lẻ."}],"p5-dai-tu":[{"src":"ETS 2026 · Test 1 · Câu 104","k":"t1-104","part":5,"q":"As a result of ------- many years leading media organizations, Ms. Ayo was selected for the Dowel Journalism Prize.","options":["she","her","hers","herself"],"answer":1,"note":"Sau giới từ \"of\" và trước cụm danh từ \"many years\" → cần tính từ sở hữu: her. \"she\" là chủ ngữ, \"hers\" là đại từ sở hữu (đứng một mình), \"herself\" là đại từ phản thân. Đứng trước danh từ thì chọn my/your/his/her/its/our/their."},{"src":"ETS 2026 · Test 5 · Câu 128","k":"t5-128","part":5,"q":"Belker Auto offers a ten-year warranty for ------- who want greater peace of mind.","options":["this","those","somebody","everyone"],"answer":1,"note":"\"for ------- who want…\" → \"those who\" = những người mà. \"those\" đi với mệnh đề \"who\" chỉ người, động từ số nhiều \"want\". \"somebody/everyone\" đi với động từ số ít (wants). \"this\" không chỉ người. Cụm \"those who + V số nhiều\" ra rất thường xuyên."}],"p5-dong-tu":[{"src":"ETS 2026 · Test 3 · Câu 129","k":"t3-129","part":5,"q":"Long before the training program began, Ms. Morris ------- the schedule to allow her team to attend.","options":["was revised","is revising","had revised","has to revise"],"answer":2,"note":"Tín hiệu thời gian \"Long before the training program began\" (quá khứ) → việc sửa lịch xảy ra TRƯỚC một mốc quá khứ → quá khứ hoàn thành \"had revised\". \"was revised\" là bị động, nhưng sau chỗ trống có tân ngữ \"the schedule\" nên phải chủ động."},{"src":"ETS 2026 · Test 4 · Câu 115","k":"t4-115","part":5,"q":"The Serenica dining table comes with levelers ------- its stability on uneven surfaces.","options":["ensure","ensures","to ensure","to be ensured"],"answer":2,"note":"Câu đã có động từ chính \"comes\". Chỗ trống cần cụm chỉ MỤC ĐÍCH: \"to ensure its stability\" (để đảm bảo độ vững). \"ensure/ensures\" sẽ tạo thêm động từ chính, sai. \"to be ensured\" là bị động, nhưng phía sau có tân ngữ \"its stability\" nên sai."}],"p6-dien-cau":[{"src":"ETS 2026 · Test 1 · Câu 135","k":"t1-135","part":6,"group":"Câu 135–138","q":"Chọn đáp án điền vào chỗ trống (135).","options":["We especially value our long-term customers.","Please join our holiday celebration.","Our annual report will be released soon.","You have been a valuable member of our team."],"answer":3,"passages":[{"title":"Letter","text":"10 January\n\nCindy Mulligan\n88 Manchester Road\nHARROGATE\nHG82 2MJ\n\nDear Ms. Mulligan,\n\nWe are delighted to celebrate your 30th anniversary with Brandrix Distribution Centre. {{135}} Your dedication, loyalty, and hard work have contributed greatly to our success over the years. We appreciate your commitment to excellence. Over the years, you {{136}} great initiative, creativity, and leadership.\n\nYou will {{137}} be receiving a commemorative plaque by post. We hope this token of our gratitude reminds you how much you mean to us.\n\nCongratulations on reaching this {{138}}. Thank you for being part of our Brandrix family.\n\nSincerely,\nLance Powar, Vice President of Human Resources\nBrandrix Distribution Centre"}],"blank":135,"note":"Chọn câu điền: đọc câu trước và câu sau. Trước: chúc mừng 30 năm gắn bó. Sau: \"Sự tận tâm, trung thành… của chị đã đóng góp\". Chỉ (D) \"Chị là thành viên quý giá của đội ngũ\" nối liền hai câu, nói với một nhân viên. (A) nói về khách hàng (sai đối tượng), (B) và (C) lạc chủ đề."},{"src":"ETS 2026 · Test 2 · Câu 141","k":"t2-141","part":6,"group":"Câu 139–142","q":"Chọn đáp án điền vào chỗ trống (141).","options":["I update the menu quarterly based on diners' feedback.","Even so, business has not been good lately.","My parents managed the bistro before I was born.","But the time has come for something new."],"answer":3,"passages":[{"title":"Article","text":"Moortap Bistro Plans to Close Its Doors\n\nWhen Rowena Ellison opened the Moortap Bistro in a remote village in the Downland Moors, she wanted to attract customers from larger towns. She {{139}} an unusual menu of local dishes prepared with less familiar ingredients, all in a beautiful setting. Her plan worked.\n\nThe {{140}} became one of the area's most successful venues and remains so now. At this point, though, Ellison says she is ready to close the bistro and retire.\n\n\"I've loved every minute of this adventure,\" says Ellison. \"I've been in the restaurant business for almost 50 years. {{141}}. It's such a {{142}} environment. I'm finally ready to slow down.\"\n\nEllison intends to spend more time in her garden. She is searching for a buyer for the bistro."}],"blank":141,"note":"Câu trước: \"Tôi làm nhà hàng gần 50 năm\". Câu sau: \"Môi trường thật… Cuối cùng tôi sẵn sàng sống chậm lại\". (D) \"Nhưng đã đến lúc cho điều mới\" nối ý nghỉ hưu. (B) \"kinh doanh dạo này không tốt\" mâu thuẫn với đoạn trên (vẫn rất thành công). (C) mâu thuẫn chuyện chính bà mở quán."}],"p6-ngu-canh":[{"src":"ETS 2026 · Test 1 · Câu 136","k":"t1-136","part":6,"group":"Câu 135–138","q":"Chọn đáp án điền vào chỗ trống (136).","options":["will show","must show","have shown","are showing"],"answer":2,"passages":[{"title":"Letter","text":"10 January\n\nCindy Mulligan\n88 Manchester Road\nHARROGATE\nHG82 2MJ\n\nDear Ms. Mulligan,\n\nWe are delighted to celebrate your 30th anniversary with Brandrix Distribution Centre. {{135}} Your dedication, loyalty, and hard work have contributed greatly to our success over the years. We appreciate your commitment to excellence. Over the years, you {{136}} great initiative, creativity, and leadership.\n\nYou will {{137}} be receiving a commemorative plaque by post. We hope this token of our gratitude reminds you how much you mean to us.\n\nCongratulations on reaching this {{138}}. Thank you for being part of our Brandrix family.\n\nSincerely,\nLance Powar, Vice President of Human Resources\nBrandrix Distribution Centre"}],"blank":136,"note":"Thì động từ theo ngữ cảnh: \"Over the years\" (trong nhiều năm qua, đến giờ) → hiện tại hoàn thành \"have shown\". Đoạn đang chúc mừng 30 năm làm việc, nên tương lai (will show) và hiện tại tiếp diễn sai mạch. Phải đọc câu quanh chỗ trống, không chỉ một câu."},{"src":"ETS 2026 · Test 1 · Câu 132","k":"t1-132","part":6,"group":"Câu 131–134","q":"Chọn đáp án điền vào chỗ trống (132).","options":["years","space","beauty","moisture"],"answer":2,"passages":[{"title":"Flyer","text":"Look to Riessler Landscaping for your Garden Needs\n\nRiessler Landscaping has everything you need to create your dream garden. We will listen to your ideas and offer suggestions that match your gardening desires. {{131}} The nursery here at Riessler Landscaping includes plants of many varieties and sizes that burst with eye-catching colors year-round. You are guaranteed to find something that will add {{132}} to your garden. We are {{133}} equipped to construct small ponds or other water features. And as our name suggests, we can take on more ambitious landscaping projects—whatever you need! With more than 40 years in the landscape–design business, {{134}} expertise is unmatched."}],"blank":132,"note":"Cả 4 phương án là danh từ, phải dựa vào ý câu trước: cây \"bừng sắc màu bắt mắt quanh năm\" → \"add beauty to your garden\" (làm vườn đẹp thêm). \"space/moisture/years\" không được câu trước gợi ý. Mẹo: câu trước chỗ trống thường cho manh mối nghĩa."}],"p6-tu-noi":[{"src":"ETS 2026 · Test 1 · Câu 145","k":"t1-145","part":6,"group":"Câu 143–146","q":"Chọn đáp án điền vào chỗ trống (145).","options":["To repeat","For instance","Otherwise","Consequently"],"answer":1,"passages":[{"title":"E-mail","text":"To: Marsha Zalen <mzalen@mansfield.com>\nFrom: Kaymar PCP <info@kaymarpcp.com>\nDate: September 8\nSubject: Your recent office visit\n\nDear Ms. Zalen,\n\nThank you for your recent visit to Kaymar Primary Care Practice. We hope you found our services {{143}}, and we welcome suggestions for improvement.\n\nWe have posted a {{144}} of your consultation on our portal. Please take a moment to go through it and let us know if you have any questions.\n\nAs a reminder, you can log in to the portal for various activities. {{145}}, you can make appointments and payments, view your medical history, review lab results, and request medication refills. {{146}} Rest assured that your personal information is safe and secure.\n\nWe thank you for your business and look forward to serving you again.\n\nKaymar Primary Care Practice"}],"blank":145,"note":"Từ nối giữa 2 câu: câu trước nói \"có thể đăng nhập cổng để làm nhiều việc\", câu sau liệt kê từng việc (đặt lịch, thanh toán, xem kết quả…) → quan hệ VÍ DỤ: \"For instance\". \"Consequently\" là kết quả, \"Otherwise\" là nếu không thì, \"To repeat\" là nhắc lại."},{"src":"ETS 2026 · Test 2 · Câu 131","k":"t2-131","part":6,"group":"Câu 131–134","q":"Chọn đáp án điền vào chỗ trống (131).","options":["Now that","After all","Otherwise","Before long"],"answer":3,"passages":[{"title":"Advertisement","text":"Muffin Lady Muffins\n\nOne day nearly 160 years ago, Arianna Sweeney brought some of her homemade muffins to the local town square to give to her friends. Everyone loved them! {{131}}, Ms. Sweeney started sharing muffins with anyone who wanted one. {{132}}. After a few months, she became known around town as the Muffin Lady.\n\nToday, Muffin Lady Muffins are made by hand {{133}} the same original recipes developed by Arianna Sweeney. We are committed to baking Muffin Lady Muffins authentically with only the finest ingredients. We hope you enjoy our delicious {{134}}!"}],"blank":131,"note":"Câu trước: mọi người đều thích bánh. Câu sau: bà bắt đầu chia bánh cho bất kỳ ai muốn. Đây là diễn tiến thời gian → \"Before long\" (chẳng bao lâu sau). \"Now that\" là liên từ, phải nối mệnh đề trong cùng câu. \"After all\" là xét cho cùng, \"Otherwise\" là nếu không thì."}],"p7-chi-tiet":[{"src":"ETS 2026 · Test 1 · Câu 147","k":"t1-147","part":7,"group":"Câu 147–148","q":"What is the purpose of the notice?","options":["To invite residents to a meeting on May 3","To request feedback about parking facilities","To inform residents of an upcoming project","To announce an increase in parking fees"],"answer":2,"passages":[{"title":"Notice","text":"Dear High View Apartments Resident,\n\nRiverside Paving Company is coming to High View Apartments on May 3 and 4 to resurface the parking area. All vehicles must be removed by 8 A.M. on May 3 for the work to commence. Residents may use the parking area again starting on May 5 at 8 A.M. We realize that trying to find another place to park is inconvenient, but it is necessary for the job to be completed in the two days scheduled. Note that all parking spaces will be widened, and some spaces could be moved during the work. You will receive an e-mail if your parking space is moved more than 20 meters from your previous one.\n\nThank you for your cooperation,\nJudith Alvarez, Property Manager"}],"blank":147,"note":"Câu mục đích, đáp án ở 1–2 câu đầu: công ty lát đường đến làm lại bãi đỗ xe ngày 3–4/5 → thông báo về một dự án sắp tới. (A) có \"May 3\" nhưng không phải cuộc họp, bẫy trùng chi tiết. (B) và (D) không được nhắc."},{"src":"ETS 2026 · Test 1 · Câu 155","k":"t1-155","part":7,"group":"Câu 155–157","q":"What is the purpose of the e-mail?","options":["To request payment","To provide operating instructions","To advertise a new product","To offer a substitute item"],"answer":3,"passages":[{"title":"E-mail","text":"Dear Ms. Longfellow,\n\nThank you for ordering the Makatasi ETX-Triple Refracting Telescope, model METX-33948. Unfortunately, the item you requested is on back order. — [1] —. If you would prefer not to wait, we have a similar telescope made by another manufacturer, Belter Telescopes. Like the Makatasi model you ordered, the Belter BTR-1483 has a 120 mm aperture and a retractable lens hood. — [2] —. In addition, all Belter telescopes include a padded carrying case. The Belter BTR-1483 costs $200 less than the Makatasi model METX-33948.\n\nIf you wish to revise your order, simply reply to this e-mail within 48 hours or go to our Web site to chat with a representative at http://www.skyviewscopes.com.au. We will then change your order, refund $200 to your credit card, and ship your new telescope overnight at no extra charge. — [3] —. Otherwise, we will notify you when the Makatasi model METX-33948 is back in stock and provide delivery information at that point. — [4] —.\n\nBest regards,\nDeon Welman\nSales Representative, Skyview Scopes"}],"blank":155,"note":"Mục đích e-mail: mẫu kính đã hết hàng, đề xuất kính tương tự của hãng khác → \"offer a substitute item\" (đề xuất món thay thế). Đọc đoạn đầu và tìm câu bắt đầu bằng \"If you would prefer…\" là thấy mục đích chính."}],"p7-suy-luan":[{"src":"ETS 2026 · Test 1 · Câu 148","k":"t1-148","part":7,"group":"Câu 147–148","q":"What is suggested about High View Apartments?","options":["It charges residents a monthly maintenance fee.","It recently hired a new property manager.","It has the parking area repaved every year.","It assigns tenants specific parking spots."],"answer":3,"passages":[{"title":"Notice","text":"Dear High View Apartments Resident,\n\nRiverside Paving Company is coming to High View Apartments on May 3 and 4 to resurface the parking area. All vehicles must be removed by 8 A.M. on May 3 for the work to commence. Residents may use the parking area again starting on May 5 at 8 A.M. We realize that trying to find another place to park is inconvenient, but it is necessary for the job to be completed in the two days scheduled. Note that all parking spaces will be widened, and some spaces could be moved during the work. You will receive an e-mail if your parking space is moved more than 20 meters from your previous one.\n\nThank you for your cooperation,\nJudith Alvarez, Property Manager"}],"blank":148,"note":"Câu suy luận \"suggested\": bài không nói thẳng nhưng có câu \"Bạn sẽ nhận e-mail nếu chỗ đỗ của bạn bị dời quá 20 m so với chỗ cũ\", tức là mỗi cư dân có chỗ đỗ riêng → (D). (C) \"năm nào cũng làm\" không có căn cứ. Suy luận phải dựa vào một câu cụ thể, không đoán theo hiểu biết bên ngoài."},{"src":"ETS 2026 · Test 1 · Câu 149","k":"t1-149","part":7,"group":"Câu 149–150","q":"What most likely is Ms. Seang's job?","options":["Glassmaker","Art instructor","Beach lifeguard","Program administrator"],"answer":1,"passages":[{"title":"Text-message chain","text":"Carol Barger (10:45 A.M.): Hello, Ms. Seang.\nLeakhena Seang (10:55 A.M.): Good morning!\nCarol Barger (11:15 A.M.): We have fifteen participants enrolled in your mosaic workshop tomorrow. That is five more than last summer. Your workshops get more popular every year! Do you have enough materials on hand for that many participants?\nLeakhena Seang (11:23 A.M.): I have plenty to go around. We'll be creating mosaic designs using bits of sea glass I collected on my vacation last summer. They are pieces of brown, green, and blue bottles that have washed up on the beach. The sand has smoothed all the sharp edges, so they're perfectly safe for everyone to use.\nCarol Barger (11:30 A.M.): Sounds good. See you tomorrow at breakfast."}],"blank":149,"note":"\"most likely is Ms. Seang's job\": bà có \"your mosaic workshop\", học viên đăng ký, bà chuẩn bị vật liệu cho cả lớp → người dạy nghệ thuật. (A) bẫy từ sea glass, (C) bẫy từ beach. Câu nghề nghiệp: tìm hoạt động người đó LÀM, không chọn theo danh từ xuất hiện."}],"p7-tin-nhan":[{"src":"ETS 2026 · Test 1 · Câu 150","k":"t1-150","part":7,"group":"Câu 149–150","q":"At 11:23 A.M., what does Ms. Seang imply when she writes, \"I have plenty to go around\"?","options":["She intends to create an extra-large mosaic.","She has been collecting sea glass for many years.","She can share her sea glass with all the workshop participants.","She does not think she will use much of her sea glass."],"answer":2,"passages":[{"title":"Text-message chain","text":"Carol Barger (10:45 A.M.): Hello, Ms. Seang.\nLeakhena Seang (10:55 A.M.): Good morning!\nCarol Barger (11:15 A.M.): We have fifteen participants enrolled in your mosaic workshop tomorrow. That is five more than last summer. Your workshops get more popular every year! Do you have enough materials on hand for that many participants?\nLeakhena Seang (11:23 A.M.): I have plenty to go around. We'll be creating mosaic designs using bits of sea glass I collected on my vacation last summer. They are pieces of brown, green, and blue bottles that have washed up on the beach. The sand has smoothed all the sharp edges, so they're perfectly safe for everyone to use.\nCarol Barger (11:30 A.M.): Sounds good. See you tomorrow at breakfast."}],"blank":150,"note":"Câu ý ngầm trong tin nhắn: đọc tin ngay TRƯỚC. Chị Barger hỏi \"có đủ vật liệu cho ngần ấy người không?\"; trả lời \"I have plenty to go around\" (có đủ chia cho mọi người) → (C). Câu sau nói về mảnh kính biển giúp xác nhận đó là vật liệu được chia."},{"src":"ETS 2026 · Test 2 · Câu 151","k":"t2-151","part":7,"group":"Câu 151–152","q":"At 9:05 A.M., what does Ms. Begani imply when she writes, \"I wouldn't miss it\"?","options":["She will be present at an upcoming workshop.","The accounting meeting is extremely important.","A social event after work promises to be fun.","She does not expect Mr. Oxley to return a document he borrowed."],"answer":0,"passages":[{"title":"Online chat discussion","text":"Priya Begani [9:02 A.M.]\nHi, Jared. Could you tell me the date of the management skills workshop you're leading?\nJared Oxley [9:03 A.M.]\nThursday, September 4. It will take up most of the day. Are you still planning to come?\nPriya Begani [9:05 A.M.]\nI wouldn't miss it! I only asked because I'm trying to decide when to schedule an accounting department meeting during that week, and the only days I'll be in the office are September 2, 3, and 4. After that, I won't be back until September 15, which would be too late.\nJared Oxley [9:06 A.M.]\nDon't forget that the office will be closed on the morning of September 2 for maintenance work. The crew is supposed to be finished by noon, but you never know.\nPriya Begani [9:07 A.M.]\nOh, right. The last time they did maintenance work, the office ended up being closed all day. That leaves only one sure date for that accounting meeting then. Thanks for reminding me.\nJared Oxley [9:08 A.M.]\nNo problem. By the way, a few of us are getting together at Ayala's Bistro after work today. Would you like to join us?\nPriya Begani [9:09 A.M.]\nI can't--I have a doctor's appointment after work. I'll go next time!"}],"blank":151,"note":"Tin trước: \"Chị vẫn định tới chứ?\" (workshop). \"I wouldn't miss it!\" = nhất định không bỏ lỡ → sẽ có mặt ở workshop → (A). (B) và (C) là chuyện khác nói ở đoạn sau, bẫy khi chỉ đọc lướt cả cuộc chat."}],"p7-chen-cau":[{"src":"ETS 2026 · Test 1 · Câu 157","k":"t1-157","part":7,"group":"Câu 155–157","q":"In which of the positions marked [1], [2], [3], and [4] does the following sentence best belong?\n\"You can see a full list of specifications on our Web site.\"","options":["[1]","[2]","[3]","[4]"],"answer":1,"passages":[{"title":"E-mail","text":"Dear Ms. Longfellow,\n\nThank you for ordering the Makatasi ETX-Triple Refracting Telescope, model METX-33948. Unfortunately, the item you requested is on back order. — [1] —. If you would prefer not to wait, we have a similar telescope made by another manufacturer, Belter Telescopes. Like the Makatasi model you ordered, the Belter BTR-1483 has a 120 mm aperture and a retractable lens hood. — [2] —. In addition, all Belter telescopes include a padded carrying case. The Belter BTR-1483 costs $200 less than the Makatasi model METX-33948.\n\nIf you wish to revise your order, simply reply to this e-mail within 48 hours or go to our Web site to chat with a representative at http://www.skyviewscopes.com.au. We will then change your order, refund $200 to your credit card, and ship your new telescope overnight at no extra charge. — [3] —. Otherwise, we will notify you when the Makatasi model METX-33948 is back in stock and provide delivery information at that point. — [4] —.\n\nBest regards,\nDeon Welman\nSales Representative, Skyview Scopes"}],"blank":157,"note":"Chèn câu \"Xem đủ thông số trên web\": câu này phải đứng ngay sau đoạn đang nói về THÔNG SỐ kỹ thuật. Vị trí [2] ngay sau \"120 mm aperture and a retractable lens hood\" (thông số) → (B). Mẹo: tìm từ khoá nối (specifications ↔ thông số vừa liệt kê)."},{"src":"ETS 2026 · Test 2 · Câu 163","k":"t2-163","part":7,"group":"Câu 161–163","q":"In which of the positions marked [1], [2], [3], and [4] does the following sentence best belong?\n\"This will be automatically applied to your shopping cart when you check out.\"","options":["[1]","[2]","[3]","[4]"],"answer":3,"passages":[{"title":"E-mail","text":"To: Lauri Woods <lauriwoods@coralmail.com>\nFrom: Customer Service <customerservice@honeycanyonapparel.com>\nDate: October 4\nSubject: Thank you\n\nDear Ms. Woods,\n\nThank you for your recent purchase! We hope you are enjoying your items. [1]\n\nWe wanted to take the opportunity to suggest some other items you might like. [2] Please visit honeycanyonapparel.com/wardrobe and enter code RN49X to see a list of suggestions curated especially for you. [3] Among the selections, we have highlighted several sweaters that would look beautiful with the skirt you bought.\n\nAnd, to thank you for being a Honey Canyon customer for so many years, we are also offering you a 20 percent discount on your next order. [4] Simply place an order within one month to receive the discount.\n\nWe look forward to helping you fill your closet with our latest styles!\n\nSincerely,\n\nCustomer Service, Honey Canyon Apparel"}],"blank":163,"note":"Câu chèn có \"This will be automatically applied…\" → \"This\" phải chỉ một thứ áp dụng vào giỏ hàng: chính là \"20 percent discount\" ngay trước [4] → (D). Câu chèn mở đầu bằng This/These/Such/However: tìm thứ nó đang chỉ tới ở câu liền trước."}],"p7-dong-nghia":[{"src":"ETS 2026 · Test 1 · Câu 182","k":"t1-182","part":7,"group":"Câu 181–185","q":"In the e-mail, the word \"conduct\" in paragraph 2, line 1, is closest in meaning to","options":["behave","accompany","transmit","carry out"],"answer":3,"passages":[{"title":"E-mail","text":"To: Manny Green <mgreen@rhba.com>\nFrom: John LaRose <jlarose@rilamore.edu>\nDate: May 18\nSubject: Drilling notice\n\nDear Mr. Green:\n\nAs a courtesy, I am writing to you at the Red Hills Business Association, asking you to help me get the word out to your membership. It was announced in last month's Daily Gazette that Rilamore University is moving forward with its Net Zero Initiative. Within three years, we expect to have geothermal wells installed and operational for the heating and cooling of our entire campus. Limiting the institution's reliance on fossil fuels has long been a goal, and the new system is a significant step toward achieving that goal.\n\nOver the next month, we will conduct test drilling in several campus locations. If all goes according to schedule, the crew will be drilling adjacent to the Red Hills Business District and Oak Street Apartments starting Wednesday, June 5. We want to tell business owners and residents near the campus to expect a higher-than-usual noise level during the two weeks we estimate it will take to complete the work. The work hours for the drilling crew are 10 A.M. to 3 P.M. each day, Monday through Friday.\n\nWe apologize in advance for the inconvenience this may cause to our neighbors. Any questions or concerns should be directed to me at 813-555-0123.\n\nJohn LaRose\nCommunity Liaison, Rilamore University Office of Communications"},{"title":"Press release","text":"FOR IMMEDIATE RELEASE\nContact: Manny Green, mgreen@rhba.com\n\nRED HILLS (May 25)—The Red Hills Business Association is shifting the dates of its much-anticipated Lunch Hour Concert Series. Normally presented each Thursday in June, the four free concerts will instead take place each Thursday in July. The lineup of artists remains unchanged—the Jaystone Jazz Trio will open the series on July 4, followed on successive Thursdays by Joss and the Jaybirds, Ray Starform, and the Barklay Bass Quintet.\n\nAs usual, all three blocks of Oak Street will be closed to traffic, restaurants will serve lunch at outdoor tables, and local arts-and-crafts vendors will display their work on the lawn of the Cultural Center. It is a beautiful celebration in the heart of a popular Red Hills neighborhood. We hope to see you there!"}],"blank":182,"note":"Từ đồng nghĩa: thay từng phương án vào câu gốc \"we will ------- test drilling\". \"carry out test drilling\" (tiến hành khoan thử) hợp nghĩa → (D). (A) behave (cư xử) là nghĩa khác của conduct, bẫy chọn nghĩa thông dụng thay vì nghĩa trong ngữ cảnh."},{"src":"ETS 2026 · Test 2 · Câu 159","k":"t2-159","part":7,"group":"Câu 158–160","q":"The word \"assure\" in paragraph 2, line 1, is closest in meaning to","options":["advise","promise","comfort","support"],"answer":1,"passages":[{"title":"Flyer","text":"Trust Gernack Home with Your Next Remodeling Project!\n\nGernack Home has proudly provided customized home-renovation solutions in the Nashville area for 30 years. We work with clients on projects of all kinds, no matter how large or small. Our specialties are renovating kitchens and bathrooms, converting basements and garages into recreation rooms or home offices, and building home additions.\n\nWe can assure you that Gernack Home installs only products of the highest quality. You will surely join our list of satisfied customers once you see the work done by our team of expert installers.\n\nCall (615) 555-0118 to schedule a visit for a free consultation. Or visit the showroom on our Web site at www.gernackhome.com. While there, take advantage of our latest feature: a virtual home renovation assistant. Our online assistants can help you build a virtual room so that you can take a first look at the renovation of your dreams."}],"blank":159,"note":"\"We can assure you that…\" = chúng tôi cam kết với bạn rằng… → promise. (C) comfort (an ủi) là nghĩa gần nhưng không thay được vào câu. Luôn thay đáp án vào câu gốc và đọc lại trước khi chọn."}],"p7-nhieu-bai":[{"src":"ETS 2026 · Test 1 · Câu 178","k":"t1-178","part":7,"group":"Câu 176–180","q":"In what field does Mr. Abruzzo most likely work?","options":["Market research","Catering","Web design","Package delivery"],"answer":2,"passages":[{"title":"Tips for designing a Web site for a food-truck business","text":"Owners of food trucks move from place to place, within and between cities, as they carry out their business, so they often rely on word of mouth or social media to attract customers. As a result, they may not build a Web site of their own. But in fact, by the very nature of their business, it is crucial that food truck owners have a fixed place for the public to learn about them, order from them, contact them, etc. Furthermore, market research shows that a Web site can help build a loyal customer base. So, here are some tips for developing a great Web site for your food truck.\n\nThe Home page should have bold graphics with your food truck's name. The text must prominently display key information, such as your truck's locations and operating hours. Online forms with fields to fill out, such as reservation requests for special events or services, give new visitors too much visual information. They are better incorporated as links or pop-up windows.\n\nThe Food Menu page needs attractive, high-definition images along with vivid and precise text that describes each menu item in detail. Remember that your photos should be big enough to look appealing on larger computer monitors.\n\nThe About Us page should include some text explaining your food truck's theme and concept, and some biographical data detailing your background in the food industry.\n\nThe News page can include text informing visitors about seasonal food items and upcoming promotions or special events such as food festivals."},{"title":"E-mail","text":"To: Doug Abruzzo <dabruzzo@dzacreative.com>\nFrom: Ed Vale <evale@saffronmail.com>\nDate: March 29\nSubject: Feedback\n\nDear Mr. Abruzzo,\n\nThank you again for creating the prototype Web site for my food-truck business. I just wanted to reiterate that it has gotten positive feedback from customers who have tested it. I am so glad we followed the advice in that article you sent me about Web site design for food trucks!\n\nAs we discussed in our phone call yesterday, we will move forward with the prototype Web site and launch it as the official site on April 5. However, I still do not see the information I sent about our new promotion that will begin in mid-April, a free dessert with any sandwich purchase. Please be sure to add this important information before we launch the site.\n\nRegards,\nEd"}],"blank":178,"note":"Bài đôi: người viết e-mail cảm ơn ông Abruzzo \"for creating the prototype Web site\". Tạo trang web → làm thiết kế web (C). (A) bẫy cụm \"market research\" trong bài 1; (B) bẫy vì khách hàng kinh doanh xe đồ ăn."},{"src":"ETS 2026 · Test 1 · Câu 183","k":"t1-183","part":7,"group":"Câu 181–185","q":"What can be concluded about the Red Hills Business District?","options":["It is located near a university campus.","It hosts an arts festival every July.","It includes the Oak Street Apartments.","It is home to the offices of the Daily Gazette."],"answer":0,"passages":[{"title":"E-mail","text":"To: Manny Green <mgreen@rhba.com>\nFrom: John LaRose <jlarose@rilamore.edu>\nDate: May 18\nSubject: Drilling notice\n\nDear Mr. Green:\n\nAs a courtesy, I am writing to you at the Red Hills Business Association, asking you to help me get the word out to your membership. It was announced in last month's Daily Gazette that Rilamore University is moving forward with its Net Zero Initiative. Within three years, we expect to have geothermal wells installed and operational for the heating and cooling of our entire campus. Limiting the institution's reliance on fossil fuels has long been a goal, and the new system is a significant step toward achieving that goal.\n\nOver the next month, we will conduct test drilling in several campus locations. If all goes according to schedule, the crew will be drilling adjacent to the Red Hills Business District and Oak Street Apartments starting Wednesday, June 5. We want to tell business owners and residents near the campus to expect a higher-than-usual noise level during the two weeks we estimate it will take to complete the work. The work hours for the drilling crew are 10 A.M. to 3 P.M. each day, Monday through Friday.\n\nWe apologize in advance for the inconvenience this may cause to our neighbors. Any questions or concerns should be directed to me at 813-555-0123.\n\nJohn LaRose\nCommunity Liaison, Rilamore University Office of Communications"},{"title":"Press release","text":"FOR IMMEDIATE RELEASE\nContact: Manny Green, mgreen@rhba.com\n\nRED HILLS (May 25)—The Red Hills Business Association is shifting the dates of its much-anticipated Lunch Hour Concert Series. Normally presented each Thursday in June, the four free concerts will instead take place each Thursday in July. The lineup of artists remains unchanged—the Jaystone Jazz Trio will open the series on July 4, followed on successive Thursdays by Joss and the Jaybirds, Ray Starform, and the Barklay Bass Quintet.\n\nAs usual, all three blocks of Oak Street will be closed to traffic, restaurants will serve lunch at outdoor tables, and local arts-and-crafts vendors will display their work on the lawn of the Cultural Center. It is a beautiful celebration in the heart of a popular Red Hills neighborhood. We hope to see you there!"}],"blank":183,"note":"Câu đối chiếu 2 bài: e-mail nói đội khoan sẽ khoan \"adjacent to the Red Hills Business District\" và cảnh báo người \"near the campus\". Ghép lại → khu kinh doanh nằm gần khuôn viên trường (A). (C) bẫy: Oak Street Apartments được nhắc cạnh khu này nhưng không thuộc khu đó."}],"p1-do-vat":[{"src":"ETS 2026 · Test 3 · Câu 5","k":"t3-5","part":1,"audio":"E26-T03-05.mp3","options":["A selection of luggage is on display.","A lamp and some papers are on a desk.","Some boxes are arranged under some lamps.","Some wire has been rolled up on the floor."],"answer":2,"img":"t03-q5.jpg","note":"Tranh không người: dãy đèn cây trên kệ, bên dưới là các hộp giấy. (C) \"boxes are arranged under some lamps\" tả đúng vị trí. (A) không có hành lý. (B) không có bàn. (D) không thấy cuộn dây trên sàn. Tranh vật: tập trung GIỚI TỪ VỊ TRÍ (under, next to, on, against) và động từ dạng bị động \"be + V3\"."},{"src":"ETS 2026 · Test 2 · Câu 3","k":"t2-3","part":1,"audio":"E26-T02-03.mp3","options":["Some wooden planks are leaning against a wall.","A vehicle is parked next to a building.","Some stones have been stacked on a pallet.","A package has been left near a door."],"answer":1,"img":"t02-q3.jpg","note":"Tranh nhà ở, có xe đậu cạnh căn nhà phía sau. (B) \"A vehicle is parked next to a building\" đúng. (A) ván gỗ nằm ngổn ngang trên đất, không dựa tường. (C) không có đá xếp trên pallet. (D) không có gói hàng cạnh cửa. Bẫy (A): đúng danh từ \"wooden planks\" nhưng sai trạng thái \"leaning against\"."}],"p5-quan-he":[{"src":"ETS 2026 · Test 2 · Câu 117","k":"t2-117","part":5,"q":"All of our tablet computers come with a one-year warranty ------- includes hardware repairs and replacements.","options":["that","who","what","it"],"answer":0,"note":"Chỗ trống đứng sau danh từ chỉ vật \"warranty\" và trước động từ \"includes\" → đại từ quan hệ làm chủ ngữ cho vật: that (hoặc which). \"who\" dùng cho người. \"what\" không đứng sau danh từ. \"it\" không nối được 2 mệnh đề."},{"src":"ETS 2026 · Test 4 · Câu 117","k":"t4-117","part":5,"q":"------- prepares the patient's medical records is required to maintain confidentiality.","options":["Whoever","Who","Whose","What"],"answer":0,"note":"Chỗ trống đứng đầu câu, cả cụm \"------- prepares the patient's medical records\" làm CHỦ NGỮ cho \"is required\". Cần \"Whoever\" (bất kỳ ai), vì nó vừa làm chủ ngữ của \"prepares\" vừa mở mệnh đề danh từ. \"Who\" đầu câu sẽ biến thành câu hỏi."}],"p7-not-true":[{"src":"ETS 2026 · Test 2 · Câu 147","k":"t2-147","part":7,"group":"Câu 147–148","q":"What is NOT offered to Radial Tunes subscribers?","options":["Access to a large library of songs","Music playlists posted by subscribers","Music videos","Audio interviews with popular musicians"],"answer":3,"passages":[{"title":"Information","text":"Enjoy Radial Tunes on Us!\n\nCongratulations on your purchase of a Gregerson Pro Phone 13. As a special gift, we are offering you a free three-month subscription to Radial Tunes, an extensive digital music library. As a Radial Tunes subscriber, you can access hundreds of songs, music videos, and playlists specially curated by other users. To subscribe, simply complete the following form. You will receive a coupon code via e-mail. To redeem it, visit www.radialtunes.com/signup and enter the code. The code is valid for one-time use only and expires 24 hours after being sent.\n\nName: Terrence Furuta\nE-mail: tfuruta@silkmail.com\nWhere did you purchase your Gregerson product?\nPNE Retailers, Winnipeg, Canada"}],"blank":147,"note":"Câu NOT: đối chiếu từng phương án với bài và gạch dần. \"hundreds of songs\" = (A), \"playlists specially curated by other users\" = (B), \"music videos\" = (C). Không có phỏng vấn nghệ sĩ → (D). Câu NOT tốn thời gian, nên để làm sau các câu chi tiết."},{"src":"ETS 2026 · Test 3 · Câu 147","k":"t3-147","part":7,"group":"Câu 147–148","q":"What service is NOT included with the special?","options":["An oil change","A filter change","A car inspection","A car wash"],"answer":3,"passages":[{"title":"Advertisement","text":"Sumner Auto Supply\nService Special\n\n$29.95\n\nService includes:\n- Conventional oil change\n- Premium oil filter change\n- Complimentary car inspection\n\nThis offer is valid only at our Smithville and Parkertown locations through August 31. Customers must present this coupon at the time of service. Limit one coupon per customer."}],"blank":147,"note":"Quảng cáo liệt kê 3 dịch vụ: thay dầu, thay lọc dầu, kiểm tra xe. Rửa xe không có → (D). Bài dạng danh sách gạch đầu dòng: đối chiếu 1–1 là ra đáp án nhanh."}]};
